    "message": "Let people sleep in the temporary-room bed they walked to\n\nA person who chose to sleep reserved a bed in a temporary room and\nwalked to it, but never slept there (#84):\n\n- the travel completion set the person idle, so they stayed awake\n  until their next decision, chose sleep again and walked again;\n- every minute, movement put everyone who was not travelling or\n  queueing back at their zone centre, so even a sleeper left the bed.\n\nThe sleep_bed arrival now leaves the person sleeping, and a sleeping\nperson with a bed reservation keeps the bed's point. The bed is still\nreleased when their next decision is not to sleep.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
